{"author":{"id":"2462ded6f56967dde059994c39a506c79e39e5dfd10c5a07f07a23a5652a8353"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1773844341,"nonce":"zcPPgUlu5+1+aE47KJrrPk2R0qI=","title":"Watcher should reload config on SIGHUP","message":"Currently the watcher reads WORKFLOW.md once at startup and never reloads. Changes to notification levels, auto_start settings, merge policy, etc. require a full watcher restart.\n\n**Desired behavior:** On receiving SIGHUP, the watcher should:\n1. Re-read and re-parse the workflow file (same path it was started with)\n2. Update the in-memory config: notification levels, auto_start settings, merge policy, review config\n3. Recreate/reconfigure adapters that depend on config (notifiers, tracker)\n4. Log what changed (e.g. \\Reloaded","files":null}]}